# Relocated kit and explicit Clang analysis run in docs-contract CI; sanitizer
# and zero-allocation evidence is retained in the batch evidence.

# M25-05: full CTest profiles include host_adapter_native/host/contract.
# Relocated package, focused sanitizers, static/allocation and lifecycle evidence
# supplement both complete profiles; prior consumers stay active.

# M26-04: native/host/external XDMA and combined tests join host_adapter filters.
